    "Id": "vehicledef_STURMFEUR_SUPPORT",
    "Name": "Sturmfeur (Support)",
    "Details": "Built to provide heavy fire support, the Sturmfeur (Support) is a specialised variant mounts an Arrow IV and 5 Thunderbolt-5's with an ER Small Laser for close range defence. A TAG allows the tank to tag targets for allied units. To fit the heavy payload, designers utilised a 255-rated Light Engine and Heavy Ferro-Fibrous armor in order to create the needed weight.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Heavy Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       350     45\n<b>Left</b>         330     45\n<b>Right</b>       330     45\n<b>Rear</b>        270     45\n<b>Turret</b>      330     45\n\n<b>Total</b>      1610    225</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Missiles</color>",
    "Icon": "Sturmfeur"
  },
